      "raw_text": "[3:45PM] #Ogudu #Alapere #TrafficUpdate \n\nGood movement from Gbagada bridge, Olopomeji connecting Ifako, Ogudu, NNPC filling station down to Tollgate while from Tollgate connecting Secretariat down to Otedola inward Berger is also perfectly ok.                                  \nReturn journey from Otedola connecting Tollgate down to Alapere all the way to Carwash inward Island is also good to go.",
